From 8ebe4bce9217eaad65e1510f187589cafff22ed3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:31:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Let other mods add lighting fixtures

StageLightBlock.Entity takes a block entity type from subclasses, so another mod's fixture
is linked and driven by the lighting console like a stage light. LightingIllumination.render
takes how far across the surface hit the faces are found (stage lights keep 8 blocks), with
rays for the background scan in proportion, and lights entities in the beam of a fixture
drawn without a console. LightingRenderer exposes where and how beams are drawn.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LqybxhWWCN1omuGBwLCHna
---
 .../lighting/LightingIllumination.java        | 36 ++++++++++++++-----
 .../lighting/LightingRenderer.java            | 21 ++++++++++-
 .../lighting/StageLightBlock.java             | 22 ++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 67 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/main/java/org/haruyq/createmediasystems/lighting/LightingIllumination.java b/src/main/java/org/haruyq/createmediasystems/lighting/LightingIllumination.java
